      "RONNIE: How you doing rookie?\nDIAMOND: I'm so nervous. I don't know if I can go out there like this.\nRONNIE: Yes you can, don't even think about it. Here.\nRONNIE: Now this is the \"Rookie Trick.\" Don't look at the customers, just look at",
      "EBONY: Well, they came up to me last week and asked if I wanted to make some extra money. I said yeah, how? They knew some people giving a party at…\nDIAMOND: And?\nDIAMOND: So what you do?\nEBONY: I danced for'em. They was paying.",
      "TINA: She just left.\nDIAMOND: With who?\nDIAMOND: What?!",
      "EBONY: It's cool Diamond.\nDIAMOND: No it ain't, get out!",
      "RONNIE: What's the matter baby?\nDIAMOND: Don't touch me, Ronnie!\nRONNIE: Diamond, didn't we start off as friends?\nDIAMOND: Yeah."
    ]
